    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>半年生活复盘：辞职、脱口秀、电摩，还有我的新人生（拟）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>在半年没有更新播客的时间里，我一直反复的揣摩</span></p><span></span><p><span>我是不是要重新开始新的阶段了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>8月开始 我穿梭于东京和长沙</span></p><span></span><p><span>我在学骑电摩</span></p><span></span><p><span>我在尝试脱口秀</span></p><span></span><p><span>我在拍摄新的vlog</span></p><span></span><p><span>我开始了商务的直播</span></p><span></span><p><span>。。。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8">00:08</a>半年没更新播客，我去哪了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">01:38</a> 提出辞职——我不想当正式社员了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">06:17</a>学电摩带来的新世界，以及第一次摔车</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="761">12:41</a>我的脱口秀初体验：紧张、混乱、但爽！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a>从单打独斗到有了靠谱的小团队</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1463">24:23</a> 人生如下棋，感谢空降女上司和自己的主动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2127">35:27</a> 两个小插曲——失败的投资与合作</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>You and Me-Penny &amp; The Quarters</span></p><span></span><p><span>诡计-何欣穗</span></p><span></span><p><span>【staff】</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：拉链</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播社媒】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/dy/微博：勺子的脑味噌（抖音是增）</span></p>]]></description>
