  <item>
    <title>EP11【对谈】3个月前我做了缩🐻手术</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67a9ec7cd74435e4a34a4a83</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67a9ec7cd74435e4a34a4a83</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Feb 2025 12:18:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期介绍】（编辑：拉链）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【嘉宾：茶妹】</span></p><span></span><p><span>抖音账号</span><a href="https://www.douyin.com/user/MS4wLjABAAAAEVOPEw1FtUWz94zDMxWbmbujH8KLHnKA3d0xPpLfiH3ST4xCBYq3NqhdQQKqfzVE" data-url="https://www.douyin.com/user/MS4wLjABAAAAEVOPEw1FtUWz94zDMxWbmbujH8KLHnKA3d0xPpLfiH3ST4xCBYq3NqhdQQKqfzVE"><span>茶妹生活日记</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>小红书账号</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/62158870000000001000b7d5?xsec_token=YBZuKjm2AfxlfhahV9WPRG4PgM6HY605gPTAkA87vqBb0=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5962c9225e87e76fc39c1a56&amp;apptime=1739331165&amp;share_id=1871730a07a549a28ae55224dd93e04a" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/62158870000000001000b7d5?xsec_token=YBZuKjm2AfxlfhahV9WPRG4PgM6HY605gPTAkA87vqBb0=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5962c9225e87e76fc39c1a56&amp;apptime=1739331165&amp;share_id=1871730a07a549a28ae55224dd93e04a"><span>茶妹生活日记</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>拥有丰满的胸部，真的意味着幸运吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>从童年时期的异样眼光，到成年后的身体负担，勺子与茶妹分享了她们在“大胸”这件事上经历的种种不适：无论是身体上的肩颈疼痛、来自异性的恶意骚扰，还是社会凝视带来的心理压力，都让茶妹最终下定决心，选择用手术改变。茶妹开诚布公地分享了自己决定手术的契机、挑选医院和医生的细节，到术前心理建设、手术的过程，再到术后痛苦恢复的点滴。不仅如此，茶妹还分享了这次手术对亲密关系的影响，在经历身体的改变后，自己与自身的关系又发生了怎样的转变。除了轻盈感带来的解脱，还有哪些值得庆幸的瞬间，又有哪些意料之外的感触？</span></p><span></span><p><span>女人从小到大，乳房就被置于被审视、被性化的位置，社会对女性身体的关注是否过度？对于胸部大小的执念，多大程度地影响了女性的自我认同？我们又是否有可能扭转这样的视角，让每个人都能更加自由地选择自己的身体？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="39">00:00:39</a>茶妹自我介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="367">00:06:07</a>接触到缩乳手术的契机和面诊tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2044">00:34:04</a>院前的心理建设和手术过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2625">00:43:45</a>术后痛到发昏，祈求发烧的医生给自己换药</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3085">00:51:25</a>术后的幸福的瞬间和意料之外的感触</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3998">01:06:38</a>抱怨大胸=凡尔赛？积怨已久的大胸困扰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4633">01:17:13</a>来自不同年龄、不同地位男性的各种骚扰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5271">01:27:51</a>术后新生：无论是身体还是家庭，一切以自己的感受为主</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>You and Me-Penny &amp; The Quarters</span></p><span></span><p><span>Photograph-Arcade Fire</span></p><span></span><p><span>【staff】</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑｜拉链</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播社媒】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/dy/微博：勺子的脑味增</span></p>]]></description>
