  <item>
    <title>EP10【不回家过年真是我长大的福报啊】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67891f3cf787119b3db98169</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67891f3cf787119b3db98169</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 Jan 2025 15:15:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【本期介绍】（编辑：拉链）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，勺子将跟大家聊聊一个充满矛盾心情的话题——不想回家过年的心情。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从失独家庭的阴影笼罩，到那些年在家里扮演的“好孩子”角色，再到充满爱和理解的姨妈，大家彼此的内心秩序像一堵看不见的墙，而面对亲戚们的催婚压力和“道德绑架”，勺子也只能佯装照单全收。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但矛盾的是，即使内心希望逃离，愧疚却无孔不入开始作祟…但勺子还是决定，“爱自己，不委屈自己”是接下来的人生信条——不回家过年，真是长大的福报啊！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="41">00:41</a> 不回家过年的心理活动：愧疚和庆幸并存</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="220">03:40</a> 情感观“炸裂”的姨妈是家里唯一能聊得来的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="462">07:42</a> 失独家庭的阴影笼罩和更年期的母亲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1055">17:35</a> 连续三年不回家过年，虽然心存愧疚，但仍觉得是长大的福报</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2247">37:27</a> 65岁以后，母亲豁然开朗，家庭阴影逐渐散去，用爱尊重彼此的内心秩序</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>You and Me-Penny &amp; The Quarters</span></p><span></span><p><span>Was-Vincent Gallo</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【staff】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑｜拉链</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【主播社媒】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5962c9225e87e76fc39c1a56?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5962c9225e87e76fc39c1a56&amp;apptime=1717041784" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5962c9225e87e76fc39c1a56?xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5962c9225e87e76fc39c1a56&amp;apptime=1717041784"><span>勺子的脑味增</span></a></p>]]></description>
