    <guid isPermaLink="false">6764e6671e823e72d34fff3c</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 20 Dec 2024 03:48:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期介绍】</span></p><span></span><p><span>我就不说了，直接听起来吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a>勺子账号简介：小红书11.9 万粉丝，抖音 8.4 万粉丝，同时经营一档播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="179">02:59</a>节点1：蓄力一年半，找到“独居”的题材</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="236">03:56</a>自媒体是场马拉松，发心和动力最重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="818">13:38</a>一年独立制作300多条视频，数量有时比质量更重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1168">19:28</a>节点2：因为臭直男而找到“猪妖”，别担心凡事都有好笑的一面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2229">37:09</a>见证自己从3万粉到5万粉再到10万粉，一路的历程与展望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2477">41:17</a>下期预告：我是怎么变现的？路上踩过的坑和感受</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>You and Me-Penny &amp; The Quarters</span></p><span></span><p><span>Good Looking-Suki Waterhouse</span></p><span></span><p><span>【staff】</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑｜拉链</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播社媒】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/dy/微博：勺子的脑味增</span></p>]]></description>
