  <item>
    <title>EP2【我给父母造了个楚门的世界】瞒着父母 我已经在东京生活两年了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67170a630d2f24f289dc9b4f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67170a630d2f24f289dc9b4f</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Oct 2024 02:13:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>#2【本期介绍】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>各位汤友好</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期回复了很多朋友对我的好奇</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>“没告诉父母来到日本生活两年”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>「我的出发点」</span></p><span></span><p><span>「我的实操方案」</span></p><span></span><p><span>「后续的维稳方案」</span></p><span></span><p><span>在长达两年的时间内，我给父母建造了一个楚门的世界。</span></p><span></span><p><span>按照他们对我的设定</span></p><span></span><p><span>我还生活在他们觉得应该要生活的城市，干着他们觉得稳定的工作，甚至我还答应了多次的网络相亲。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我愿意是因为我很爱他们。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但我也很爱我自己</span></p><span></span><p><span>我不想因为爱别人放弃爱自己</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以我</span></p><span></span><p><span>离职了 kuku接私活攒钱了</span></p><span></span><p><span>出国了 找到工作了 生存下来了</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一路上的事情我没办法跟他们共享</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是我却第一次感受到了原来我可以如此掌握自己的人生</span></p><span></span><p><span>原来人生还有这么多种使用方法</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期【shownotes】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>家庭状况</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:00:58</a></span></strong><span>“战狼父母”和“抗议示威”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="254">00:04:14</a></span></strong><span>失独家庭的自由和限制：干啥都行，出远门不行</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="363">00:06:03</a></span></strong><span>目前现状：到东京一年还没有坦白</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>为什么不告诉父母？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="419">00:06:59</a></span></strong><span>选择哪里都是一样的，都是换个地方打工</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="499">00:08:19</a></span></strong><span>给自己留条后路，避免“乘兴而来 ，败兴而归”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>现在的生活现状</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="677">00:11:17</a></span></strong><span>家庭大讨论</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">00:14:20</a></span></strong><span>大嘴巴爸爸和“湖南人的第二故乡”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1122">00:18:42</a></span></strong><span>给爸妈造了一个“楚门的世界”——我的生存之道</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">00:23:30</a></span></strong><span>三十岁的成人礼——生存的命题</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1613">00:26:53</a></span></strong><span>下期预告/一点题外话</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期音乐】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>You and Me-Penny &amp; The Quarters</span></p><span></span><p><span>Trip To Japan-The Shacks</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【staff】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑｜拉链</span></p><span></span><p><span>shownotes｜拉链</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播｜勺子</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【夹杂私货】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/抖音 勺子的脑味增</span></p>]]></description>
