  <item>
    <title>EP1【我为人生献上一计】日语0点 勇闯日娱做牛马</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f0f6ac97f8a7cb17a0e8c6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f0f6ac97f8a7cb17a0e8c6</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Sep 2024 05:03:39 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>#1【本期介绍】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>汤友们好</span></p><span></span><p><span>我是东京独居猪妖 勺子</span></p><span></span><p><span>2022年我瞒着家里，辞掉工作， 问同事借了4万彩礼钱，来到了日本。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2024年的我，在一家日娱公司上班，还清了前期的负债，生活逐渐的稳定下来后，我才有心去品味这一路坑坑洼洼中的有意思，起起伏伏里的生命力。</span></p><span></span><p><span>想诚恳的分享给大家，或者我太想梳理这里面的妙处了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是第一期，希望还会有好多好多期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「东京独居猪妖的杂谈，生活妙游，请你喝碗猪杂汤！这就成了播客的名字了」</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【shownotes】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="27">00:00:27</a> 生活现状盘点——在日本娱乐公司上班。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">00:01:35</a>不会做自媒体，就先用自己的账号做。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">00:02:46</a>我为什么想来日本娱乐圈当“牛马”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="264">00:04:24</a>在国内干综艺编导的工作经验和瓶颈。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="496">00:08:16</a>在国内厌学上班，看见工作就心口痛，每天只想做饭！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="879">00:14:39</a>我是怎么实操，让自己来到日本的呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">00:15:30</a>用自己做的中华料理找到了第一份拉面馆打工的兼职。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1118">00:18:38</a>踩中第一个大坑，进了朋友介绍的华人公司。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1280">00:21:20</a>日语读写简直硬伤，还好有chatgpt，硬着头皮找到新工作了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1588">00:26:28</a>没想到之前讨厌的经验帮助了我，进入日本娱乐业？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1693">00:28:13</a>目前的感受，甚至有点无聊了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1952">00:32:32</a>下期预告</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【staff】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑｜拉链</span></p><span></span><p><span>shownote｜拉链</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播｜勺子</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【夹杂私货】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>小红书/抖音 勺子的脑味增</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎关注</span></p>]]></description>
